{"event":"pre_tool","ts":1772871810331,"session":"ralph-20260307-082232","tool":"create","args":"{\"path\": \"/workspace/.ralph/tasks/DOC-3141/state.md\", \"file_text\": \"# Review State: DOC-3141 — Tag attribute editor validation\\n\\n## Current Phase\\nPhase 1: Setup\\n\\n### Skills for this phase\\n- malph-vscode-workflow-setup\\n\\n> ⚠️ STOP — Read every skill listed above BEFORE doing any work in this phase.\\n\\n## Completed Phases\\n(none yet)\\n\\n## Tracked Identifiers\\n- Branch: ralph/doc-3141\\n- PR ID: 2901\\n- PR URL: https://dev.azure.com/KenticoCustomerSuccess/CustomerEducation/_git/kentico-docs-autocomplete-vscode/pullrequest/2901\\n\\n## Ralphchives Findings\\nNo prior task reports found for DOC-3141. Related entries:\\n- DOC-3175: Status tag color constants autocomplete (recent, shows pattern of attribute value completions)\\n- General observations: Static attribute values pattern, definition-driven architecture notes\\n\\n## Reviewer Verdicts\\n| Reviewer | Verdict | Findings |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| malph-reviewer-opus | pending | — |\\n| malph-reviewer-gpt | pending | — |\\n| malph-reviewer-gemini | pending | — |\\n\\n## Panel Verdict\\n(will be aggregated after all reviewers complete)\\n\"}"}
{"event":"pre_tool","ts":1772871810450,"session":"ralph-20260307-082232","tool":"jira-kentico-jira_add_comment","args":"{\"body\": \"h2. 🦇 The signal is lit. Malph has arrived.\\n\\nI'm not the reviewer you want. I'm the reviewer you need.\\n\\nAssembling the review panel for PR [#2901|https://dev.azure.com/KenticoCustomerSuccess/CustomerEducation/_git/kentico-docs-autocomplete-vscode/pullrequest/2901] — three independent reviewers will scrutinize every line of this validation work.\\n\\n*Review Panel:*\\n| Reviewer | Model | Status |\\n| malph-reviewer-opus | Opus 4.6 | 🔜 Queued |\\n| malph-reviewer-gpt | GPT 5.4 | 🔜 Queued |\\n| malph-reviewer-gemini | Gemini Pro | 🔜 Queued |\\n\\nScout deploying first for diff mapping and build validation. Stand by.\"}"}
