{"event":"pre_tool","ts":1772872024772,"session":"ralph-20260307-082232","tool":"task","args":"{\"agent_type\": \"ralph.malph-reviewer-opus\", \"description\": \"Opus reviews PR 2901\", \"mode\": \"sync\", \"prompt\": \"You are reviewing PR #2901 for DOC-3141 (Tag attribute editor validation) on branch `ralph/doc-3141` targeting `main`.\\n\\n**Issue:** Add missing editor-level validation across all tag definitions with reusable, generic validation rules. Two revisions were done adding 5 generic rules total plus dataType on all attributes.\\n\\n**Scout artifacts:** Read `.ralph/tasks/DOC-3141/artifacts/malph-scout/output.md` for the full diff mapping, changed file list, and build results (all pass: compile, lint, 452 tests).\\n\\n**Your tasks:**\\n1. Read the scout's output.md for context\\n2. Run `git diff main...ralph/doc-3141` to see the actual diff\\n3. Read the full review checklist and run all 7 categories\\n4. Post file-level PR threads on PR #2901 for any findings (use your model attribution prefix)\\n5. Write `jira-findings.json` to `.ralph/tasks/DOC-3141/artifacts/malph-reviewer-opus/`\\n6. Write `status.json` to `.ralph/tasks/DOC-3141/artifacts/malph-reviewer-opus/`\\n\\nCreate the `malph-reviewer-opus/` subdirectory under `.ralph/tasks/DOC-3141/artifacts/`.\\n\\n**status.json format:**\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"approved\\\" | \\\"needs-revision\\\",\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"<brief verdict summary>\\\",\\n  \\\"findingsCount\\\": <number>,\\n  \\\"prId\\\": 2901\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**jira-findings.json format:**\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"code\\\": \\\"ISSUE-CODE\\\",\\n      \\\"severity\\\": \\\"critical\\\" | \\\"style\\\" | \\\"suggestion\\\",\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"path/to/file\\\",\\n      \\\"line\\\": <number>,\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"What's wrong and why\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\"}"}
