{"event":"pre_tool","ts":1772872847444,"session":"ralph-20260307-082232","tool":"create","args":"{\"file_text\": \"# Review Handoff — DOC-3141\\n\\n## Panel Verdict: APPROVED\\n\\nUnanimous approval from all three reviewers. No blocking issues found.\\n\\n## Review Panel\\n| Reviewer | Model | Verdict | Findings |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| malph-reviewer-opus | Opus 4.6 | approved | 2 suggestions |\\n| malph-reviewer-gpt | GPT 5.4 | approved | 4 suggestions |\\n| malph-reviewer-gemini | Gemini Pro | approved | 3 suggestions |\\n\\n## Build Status (from scout)\\n- Compile: PASS\\n- Lint: PASS\\n- Tests: PASS (452 passing)\\n- Changed files: 39\\n\\n## PR\\n- Branch: ralph/doc-3141\\n- PR URL: https://dev.azure.com/KenticoCustomerSuccess/CustomerEducation/_git/kentico-docs-autocomplete-vscode/pullrequest/2901\\n\\n## Aggregated Findings Summary\\n\\n**0 critical, 0 style, 5 suggestions** (deduplicated across 3 reviewers)\\n\\n| Code | File | Flagged by | Description |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| SUG-001 | src/definitions/tags/block/card/diagnostics/imageAttrConflict.ts | opus, gpt, gemini | Orphaned dead code file — custom rule replaced by declarative mutuallyExclusiveWith but file not deleted |\\n| SUG-002 | src/logic/diagnostics/tags/rules/validateDuplicateAttributes.rule.ts:3 | gpt, gemini | Unused import `findTagAttributeNameRange` |\\n| SUG-003 | src/logic/diagnostics/tags/rules/validateDuplicateAttributes.rule.ts:27 | gpt, gemini | Duplicate detection regex may false-positive on `=` inside quoted attribute values |\\n| SUG-004 | Multiple rule files | opus | Unused `TagValidationContext` import in 3 rule files |\\n| SUG-005 | src/logic/diagnostics/tags/rules/validateEmptyRequiredAttributeValue.rule.ts:28 | gpt | Inconsistent diagnostic message format for positional vs named attributes |\\n\\n## Reviewer: 🦇 Malph\\n\", \"path\": \"/tmp/mcp-attachments/review-handoff-DOC-3141.md\"}"}
